{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p015c","title":"敕毌丘俭按兵守新城","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p015c-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"敕毌丘俭按兵守新城","evidence":["shaodi-e-p015c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0048","role":"守城","evidence":["shaodi-e-p015c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":253,"label":"诸葛恪围新城时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y253","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o055","basis":"诸葛恪围新城时"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-p015c-q","shaodi-q-o055","shaodi-q-b-aa6ace448e938821edac"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-p015c-q","source_order":[4,262,"P015c"],"order":1100}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0048","name":"毌丘俭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p015c-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-abab653a2877dfa83b51","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“是时姜维亦出，围狄道。司马景王问虞松曰：‘今东西有事，二方皆急；而诸将意沮，若之何？’松曰：‘昔周亚夫坚壁昌邑，而吴楚自败；事有似弱而强，或似强而弱，不可不察也。今恪悉其锐众，足以肆暴；而坐守新城，欲以致一战耳。若攻城不拔，请战不得；师老众疲，势将自走；诸将之不径进，乃公之利也。姜维有重兵而悬军应恪，投食我麦，非深根之寇也。且谓我并力于东，西方必虚，是以径进。今若使关中诸军倍道急赴，出其不意，殆将走矣。’景王曰：‘善！’乃使郭淮、陈泰悉关中之众，解狄道之围；敕毌丘俭等按兵自守，以新城委吴。姜维闻淮进兵，军食少，乃退屯陇西界。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":261,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2fe8a525b487e3e8ceb8","start":0,"end":278,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-aa6ace448e938821edac","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-aa6ace448e938821edac","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：嘉平五年（公元 253）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4e568bedcd1f34c38680","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o055","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2d3651c906b3924f6677","layer":"original","quote":"五年夏四月〖1〗，大赦。五月，吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城；诏太尉司马孚拒之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
